For equal RMS speeds,
\[
\sqrt{\frac{3RT_{\mathrm{He}}}{M_{\mathrm{He}}}}
=\sqrt{\frac{3RT_{\mathrm{N_2}}}{M_{\mathrm{N_2}}}}
\]
Square both sides and cancel \(3R\):
\[
\frac{T_{\mathrm{He}}}{M_{\mathrm{He}}}
=\frac{T_{\mathrm{N_2}}}{M_{\mathrm{N_2}}}
\]
Thus
\[
T_{\mathrm{He}}=T_{\mathrm{N_2}}\frac{M_{\mathrm{He}}}{M_{\mathrm{N_2}}}
=(300)\frac{4.0\times10^{-3}}{2.8\times10^{-2}}
=43\,\mathrm{K}
\]
